NULUCY REM 0639 06010            EXTENDED FORTRAN 2 BSS LOADER          LUCY 001
       REM PERFORM ALL FUNCTIONS OF THE FORTRAN BINARY SYMBOLIC SUBROU- LUCY 002
       REM TINE LOADER, AND WILL IN ADDITION EXECUTE THE FOLLOWING -    LUCY 003
       REM                                                              LUCY 004
       REM   1. LUCY WILL LOAD ABSOLUTE BINARY CORRECTION CARDS (9-ROW  LUCY 005
       REM      BLANK, THEN WORD IN RIGHT OF ROW IS LOADED INTO ADDRESS LUCY 006
       REM      IN LEFT OF ROW).                                        LUCY 007
       REM                                                              LUCY 008
       REM   2. LUCY WILL WRITE A SELF-LOADING PROGRAM TAPE OF TWO      LUCY 009
       REM      RECORDS ON TAPE 1 IF SENSE SWITCH 5 IS DOWN.  THE FIRST LUCY 010
       REM      RECORD INITIALIZES THE MACHINE AND THE SECOND RECORD IS LUCY 011
       REM      A COMPRESSION OF THE NON-ZERO LOCATIONS OF THE          LUCY 012
       REM      PROGRAM.  IF SENSE SWITCH 2 IS DOWN, TAPE 1 IS NEVER    LUCY 013
       REM      REWOUND, OTHERWISE IT IS REWOUND BEFORE AND AFTER THE   LUCY 014
       REM      PROGRAM TAPE IS WRITTEN.                                LUCY 015
       REM                                                              LUCY 016
       REM   3. WHEN LOADING A TAPE WRITTEN BY LUCY, CONTROL MAY BE     LUCY 017
       REM      TRANSFERRED BACK TO THE BINARY CARD LOADER BY           LUCY 018
       REM      DEPRESSING SENSE SWITCH 6.  SINCE THE PROGRAM TAPE IS   LUCY 019
       REM      WRITTEN AT THE END OF THE FIRST LOADER PASS, IT IS      LUCY 020
       REM      POSSIBLE TO READ NEW SYMBOLIC SUBROUTINES AT THIS TIME  LUCY 021
       REM      WHICH WILL BE USED IN THE CURRENT OPERATION. IF SENSE   LUCY 022
       REM      SWITCH 2 IS DOWN, THE PROGRAM TAPE IS NOT REWOUND       LUCY 023
       REM      AFTER BEING LOADED IN. IF SENSE SWITCH 5 IS ALSO DOWN   LUCY 024
       REM      DURING TAPE READ-IN, A NEW PROGRAM TAPE WILL BE WRITTEN LUCY 025
       REM      AFTER A FORTRAN TRANSFER CARD (9L ROW = -0) HAS BEEN    LUCY 026
       REM      ENCOUNTERED IN THE CARD READER.                         LUCY 027
       REM                                                              LUCY 028
       REM   4. IF SENSE SWITCH 1, OR SENSE SWITCH 3, IS DOWN WHEN LOAD-LUCY 029
       REM      ING FROM EITHER CARDS OR TAPE, A MAP OF THE SUBPROGRAM  LUCY 030
       REM      ARRANGEMENT IN THE CORE IS WRITTEN ON TAPE OUTAP, OR ON LUCY 031
       REM      THE ON-LINE PRINTER, RESPECTIVELY.                      LUCY 032
       REM                                                              LUCY 033
       REM   5. A CHECKSUM OR REDUNDANCY ERROR WHEN LOADING A PROGRAM   LUCY 034
       REM      TAPE WRITTEN BY LUCY RESULTS IN AN ERROR HALT. PRESSING LUCY 035
       REM      START RESULTS IN AN ATTEMPT TO RE-READ THE TAPE. TO     LUCY 036
       REM      BYPASS THIS CHECK, PRESS RESET AND THEN PRESS START.    LUCY 037
       REM                                                              LUCY 038
       REM   6. AFTER THE ENTIRE BINARY PROGRAM DECK HAS BEEN LOADED,   LUCY 039
       REM      THE NAMES OF ANY MISSING SUBROUTINES WILL BE PRINTED OUTLUCY 040
       REM      ON THE ON-LINE PRINTER, FOLLOWED BY A STOP. PRESSING    LUCY 041
       REM      START ON THE CONSOLE WILL CAUSE THE LOADER TO ASK       LUCY 042
       REM      FOR THE MISSING SUBROUTINES.                            LUCY 043
       REM                                                              LUCY 044
       REM   7. IMMEDIATELY BEFORE THE LOADER IN UPPER MEMORY IS        LUCY 045
       REM      DESTROYED AND CONTROL IS TRANSFERRED TO THE PROGRAM     LUCY 046
       REM      LOADED, A TEST IS MADE OF SENSE SWITCH 4. IF SWITCH     LUCY 047
       REM      4 IS DOWN, THE PROGRAM HALTS BEFORE TRANSFERRING        LUCY 048
       REM      CONTROL.  THIS MAY BE USEFUL TO ADJUST SENSE SWITCH     LUCY 049
       REM      SETTINGS, OBTAIN INITIAL MACHINE CONDITIONS, OR         LUCY 050
       REM      EXECUTE OTHER CHECKING PROCEDURES.                      LUCY 051
       REM                                                              LUCY 052
       REM ALL OTHER OPERATIONS PERFORMED BY LUCY ARE ESSENTIALLY THE   LUCY 053
       REM SAME AS THOSE PERFORMED BY THE FORTRAN 2 BSS LOADER.         LUCY 054
       REM FOR MORE DETAILED INFORMATION ABOUT LUCY, INCLUDING A        LUCY 055
       REM LIST OF ERROR STOPS AND REMEDIAL PROCEDURES, THE USER IS     LUCY 056
       REM REFERRED TO AN ACCOMPANYING WRITE-UP.                        LUCY 057
       REM                                                              LUCY 058
       REM NEW YORK, NEW YORK                                           LUCY 059
       REM APRIL, 1960                                                  LUCY 060
